{{Illusionnotes
| name = Feral Impulse
| desc = The created [[illusion]]s benefit from the bonus {{M|health regeneration}} component, but not the flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} component.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Feral Impulse icon0}}
| desc = Increases the HP regeneration and damage of Lycan and all units under his control.
}}
* Lycan-based {{M|illusions}} grants its owner and the owner's player-controlled units all ability bonuses.
** However, the {{M|aura}} only affect the {{A|Enchantress|Enchant|text=Enchanted}} illusion itself.


{{Illusionnotes
| name = Wolf Bite
| desc = Other {{A|Lycan|Shapeshift}} notes apply.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Wolf Bite
| desc = All ability values are based on Lycan's {{A|Lycan|Shapeshift}} corresponding level when acquired.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Wolf Bite
| desc = Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Scepter}} while drafting {{A|Lycan|Shapeshift}} unlocks this ability.
}}

 * Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Scepter}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.

* {{Symbol|bonus ls}}
** Both [[lifesteal]] component applied to Lycan and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted allied hero are independent of each other.
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
*** {{hi|Lycan}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***# Lycan's attack instance.
***# Lycan's self-[[lifesteal]]-based heal.
***# The attack instance applies a lifesteal-based heal to the buff-affected allied hero.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{to}} {{hi|Lycan}}
***# The buff-affected allied hero's attack instance.
***# The buff-affected allied hero's self-lifesteal-based heal.
***# The attack instance applies a lifesteal-based heal to the Lycan.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
** {{M|Disable Help}} on Lycan prevents Wolf Form from affecting the allied hero.
** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
** Does not affect the following units:
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** {{Symbol|a|Transform}}
*** Other {{A|Lycan|Shapeshift}} [[transformation ability]] notes apply, and grants the following ability components to the allied hero.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|lycan_shapeshift}}
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|lycan_shapeshift_speed}}
*** Recasting the ability on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted allied hero refreshes its duration and adapts the ability values accordingly.
** {{Symbol|Summons}}
*** The buff-affected allied hero's [[player-controlled units]] are not affected by other Shapeshift ability components.

 * Applies a generic {{M|outgoing damage}} amplification on Lycan and his {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.
** Stacks additively with other outgoing damage manipulation sources.
** Does not affect {{M|HP Removal}} sources.
** Does not affect the following units:
*** Lycan' {{M|illusions}}.
*** {{M|Roshan}}
*** The {{M|Tormentor}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Outgoing damage}}: {{Code|{{#var:Apex Predator value2}} + ({{#var:Apex Predator basic1}} × SelfLVL)}}

{{Illusionnotes
| name = Shapeshift
| desc = Displays {{M|critical strike}} values before all [[damage manipulation]] sources for camouflaging purposes.<br><br>The ability duration {{M|buff}} is the same of Lycan's for camouflaging purposes.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Shapeshift
| desc = {{H|Rubick}} transforms into a smaller wolf form and grants all ability effects upon cast.
}}

